This reference package is not licensed under the repository root Apache-2.0
licence.

It contains derived reference alignments, tree tip identifiers, and clade
metadata whose source-by-source redistribution rights have not yet been
documented for a public release. It remains available only in the private
development repository with the repository owner's permission. No permission
is granted to redistribute, publish, sublicense, or make this package publicly
available until a maintainer records the applicable source permissions in a
release decision.

This restriction does not apply to the TreeTip Placer source code or to the
synthetic fixtures under tests/fixtures/.
